    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Eternian Amendments</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;â€œWhen you see a woman, say, in a tight skirt, or perhaps in the locker room, in the showers...â€ Light Hope trailed off, looking at Adora expectantly who shifted uncomfortably and continuing gently when she didnâ€™t answer. â€œYou donâ€™t have any... unnatural thoughts?â€&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;â€œI donâ€™t think itâ€™s unnatural."&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;or&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Adora gets more than she bargains for when she meets Catra at the conversion camp her parents sent her to in order to rid her of her so-called lesbianism. Though Adora still feels confused, her developing feelings make her problems so much worse.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
